  "notes": "The outlaw-lineage producer who took this archetype's Texas/Americana wing to Grammy scale — two production wins from five nominations, on Brandi Carlile's *By the Way, I Forgive You* and Tanya Tucker's *While I'm Livin'*. The research is unusually direct about how to encode him, and this model follows it literally: \"as producer, a live rhythm section with the shuffle or two-beat chosen per song rather than a house groove … no fixed production template, per-project sound design. For the engine, treat him as a *variance* setting rather than a preset.\" Variance is authored as width rather than as a value — the widest kick density in the section (2–5), the widest velocity spread (100–127 accent over a 70–98 main and 26–50 ghosts), a wide hat velocity range, an open hat on both 2& and 4&, a three-lane perc stack with a 2–8 density, humanize loosened to 0.68/0.28, and the highest switchUpProb in the batch at 0.4 with wide section-bar ranges for the documented concept-album structures with interludes. session.swing is deliberately left inherited from country-shuffle: with the shuffle or the two-beat chosen per song, a single authored ratio would be exactly the house groove the research says he does not have. Harmony is his own — I–IV–V with V7, twelve-bar frames, and minor modal writing, because his catalogue is documented as blending \"hard rock and outlaw country\" and extending into \"metal and electronic music\". The bass is \"live bass, root–five or walking per idiom; electronics available as a layer, which is unusual in this archetype\" — independent_riff at 0.78 with a real glide probability, which no other model in this section carries. ⚠ INFERRED: bpm.mode 110 (the entry gives a 55–170 band with no centre), all velocity tiers, ghost probability and vel, the hat and percs densities, and the whole melody block — no melodic or vocal parameter is documented for him, so the melody is authored as a wide, neutral reading of the same variance principle. The research states plainly that \"no tracking-method or technique documentation was reachable, so the groove and mix parameters above are inferred and marked [LOW-CONF]\", and rates the entry medium, which is what confidence carries here.",
